      "paperId": "12a87f1e0a9778b1899c08e4c9fbe647b907f880",
      "title": "PHILOSOPHY OF EDUCATION AND RESTORATION OF EDUCATIONAL PRINCIPLES IN THE CONCEPT OF JURGEN HABERMAS",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "O. Tytar",
          "authorId": "2258213225"
        },
        {
          "name": "Nataliia Fradkin\u0430",
